+  `<exit-code> 0 </exit-code>`.
+- Haskell `kompile` for `verification.k`: exit `0`; warnings were unused
+  variables in the supplied read-only `str.k`.
+- Six-claim nonempty/support `kprove`: `#Top`, exit `0`
